---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="The Blueprint" description="A repeatable methodology for strategic clarity.">
  <section class="container section grid gap-8">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="kicker">The Methodology</span>
      <h1 class="serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl">A practical, repeatable way to move faster.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-2xl">
        I focus on marketing clarity, strong content, and product activation that stands up in the
        real world.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <span class="tag">01</span>
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl mt-4">The Translation Layer</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          Translate product detail into plain-language positioning, content, and UX.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <span class="tag">02</span>
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl mt-4">The Exit Framework</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          Package the story with clear metrics, clean positioning, and proof of demand.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          Examples: Props to Realtor.com. Nudge to WEST.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <span class="tag">03</span>
        <h2 class="serif text-2xl mt-4">The Community Flywheel</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">
          Use advisory boards and peers to pressure-test messaging and activation plans.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-8">
      <span class="kicker">What It Looks Like in 30 Days</span>
      <div class="mt-4 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
          <p class="font-semibold">Week 1</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
            Stakeholder interviews, product audit, and a clear marketing brief.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
          <p class="font-semibold">Week 2-3</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
            Positioning, messaging, and content direction with narrative samples.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
          <p class="font-semibold">Week 4</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
            Rollout plan with priorities, owners, and a measurable schedule.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
